# Spirecrest Roofs (CIPlay spirecrest_roofs): the beacon roof, the distress card, the screechers, the beacon hut's chest
# (Receiver), the mast toolbox (Antenna), the caretaker's diary, Ines's two slates.
island Spirecrest Roofs
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rooftops
zone beacon
expect step 1
read Pelagic Network distress card
expect step 2
kill Screecher
expect step 3
open Beacon hut chest
wait 3
expect step 4
open Mast toolbox
wait 3
expect step 5
read Rooftop caretaker's diary
expect step 6
read Ines's slate (the coop)
expect step 7
zone sc_ridge
expect step 8
read Pump-man's slate
expect step 9
read Courier's logbook
expect step 10
air sc_dair
open Exchange strongbox
wait 3
expect story sc_key 1
expect step 11
zone sc_summit
expect step 12
open Relay locker
wait 3
expect step 13
read Ines's slate (Signal Hill)
expect step 14
# U22 jump course (10-24): teleport onto its top A slab instead of jumping the hops
at -48.38 -55.44 h=9.65
zone jump_sc_top
wait 2
expect done
